<title>THAILAND: SOCCER-KING'S CUP FOUR-NATION TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KING'S CUP FOUR-NATION TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of matches in the four-nation King's Cup soccer tournament on Tuesday:</p>
<p> Thailand    0    Sweden    0</p>
<p> Japan	 1    Romania   1 (halftime (0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Japan - Kazu Miura 84</p>
<p>Romania - Cristian Bolohan 58</p>
<p>Next matches: February 13 - Thailand v Romania (0900 GMT kickoff), Japan v Sweden (1200 GMT kickoff).</p>
</text>
